// Dialog :
"P3798270611" "So, the Freakshow's suppliers called themselves Nemesis? Interesting. I assume you've heard of the arch-villain, Nemesis, who tried to take over the United States during the 40's. No one's heard of him since before the Rikti War; it seems unlikely that he's still alive and in control of this army. Maybe they're simply a bunch of copycats. Whichever way it plays out, we'll have to keep a close eye on these Nemesis soldiers."
// RandomFameString :
"P590793479" "I heard that the Freakshow almost got some crazy new weapons, but {HeroName} put a stop to their nonsense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Nemesis_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NemesisPropoganda 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P419832602" "Nemesis poster"
// DetailString :
"P1031684482" "This poster shows a soldier fitted out with high tech weaponry and armor. At the bottom are the words, 'Nemesis: the real heroes in town. Join up now.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NemesisRecruiting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1239004585" "Nemesis pamphlet"
// DetailString :
"P1136935649" "This pamphlet outlines the goals of the Nemesis organization, which seem laudable if somewhat extreme. Their stated mission is to rid Paragon City of crime. They plan to do this by creating the greatest army the world has ever seen, thereby replacing the heroes termed 'hazards to the peace.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1041170790" "I got word of a big recruitment drive going on in an abandoned office today. Mid-level members from the Freakshow, Crey, and the Council have been invited, as well as representatives from a lot of other gangs. The thing is, I can't figure out who's doing the recruiting! Whoever they are, they're looking to make a big move soon, we can be sure of that. I need you to investigate the mysterious gang recruiting drive. The first step to stopping these new villains is finding out everything we can about them. <br><br>Whatever you do, don't let their ringleader escape. If he does, we'll have to consider this one a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P2620636634" "Investigate the mysterious gang recruiting drive"
// SendOffString :
"P1282431499" "Thanks, {HeroName}. The main objectives are to find out more about who is doing the recruiting and why. I suggest you look for any kind of propaganda or documents you can. You'll also need to find whoever the main recruiter is. All my contacts have on that is a name: Danforth. <br><br>Remember, you'll be facing a lot of villain groups, including the Freakshow and the Sky Raiders. Last time I checked, they didn't like you much."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1627802736" "Look into villain recruiting drive"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P543306829" "That villain recruiting drive is going on right now. I need you to be my eyes and ears there."

