// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Nemesis_Compound2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2932405708" "I still need to know whether Nemesis is back!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2442580745" "Do you never learn, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1889992180" "Once again, the tinny chirp of a cheap security system grates against your ear."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P756459340" "Has the lab been secured?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3318106751" "Soon. Orders are for no survivors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3360163499" "Let's see how you fare against a real soldier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P590647589" "Lt. Creed"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3824215272" "Nemesis will be pleased that we've covered his tracks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3851883079" "You may know the truth, but you'll never live to tell it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2821156322" "I did the trace! Listen to this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1683764547" "Thank you, {Rescuer}! Thank you so much!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P594825599" "You saved the scientists and learned some interesting information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P704583856" "Nemesis. I remember reading about him in history books; the guy has been wreaking havoc worldwide since the 1800's. This could be the deadliest threat Paragon City has ever faced. Thank goodness I have you to rely on, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P3182032466" "Did you hear? Nemesis may be back!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Nemesis_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4151295758" "The sudden reappearance of the 'Nemesis Army' has a lot of people concerned, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to ask you to start combating them.</A> Confront them, stop whatever plans they may have, and find out what the city may be facing."
// AcceptString :
"P1559088448" "Fight the soldiers of the Nemesis Army."
// SendOffString :
"P3041213787" "If this Nemesis Army is really linked to the original Nemesis, then the threat to the city and to the world may be far greater than a lot of people are thinking. If you need to find them, I'd suggest looking around Eden and Crey's Folly for them, but anywhere you can confront them should be good."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4087869499" "Combat Nemesis menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2841932474" "I need you to defeat some more Nemesis soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2848765542" "Do you think to stop us, {HeroName}? Preposterous!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2297686332" "You have cleared out enough Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1027426600" "Nemesis is a generations old threat, {HeroName}, one that a lot of people had hoped was finally gone for good. He's held the entire world in fear several times over his nearly 180-year history of terror. I don't know for sure if this Nemesis Army is the real deal or a bunch of copy-cats, but they'll have to be fought wherever they show themselves."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Nemesis_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1041023340" "There have been reports of Nemesis troops at work in Founders' Falls. They may be scouting for bases or testing their skills against the Devouring Earth and the Rikti, but either way <A HREF={ACCEPT}>they need to be stopped and I'd like to ask you to fight them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3431489842" "Go to Founders' Falls and defeat Nemesis troops."
// SendOffString :
"P2017845882" "I'm certain you're aware that Founders' Falls is a dangerous place to do anything, much less to fight Nemesis troops. I'd suggest that you go in force. I've mostly heard of Nemesis forces massing around Hutchinson Park and the Red River, but you can fight them anywhere in Founders' Falls and still have an impact."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2765775816" "Stop Nemesis in Founders' Falls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P41413531" "Go to Founders' Falls and defeat Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4074750416" "Do not interfere with our operations in Founders' Falls, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P238882878" "You have defeated enough Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P13073640" "The original Nemesis was known for intricate plans within plans. Whether or not he controls the new Nemesis Army, they may be working along those lines. Maybe those soldiers were there in advance of some larger operation? Or maybe to distract from an operation somewhere else? It makes my head spin sometimes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Nemesis_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3915462682" "You'd think that no one would ever want to go to the polluted wasteland of Crey's Folly, but it seems that the Nemesis Army has been working in the area. I don't know what their plans are, but they can't be up to any good. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to ask you to impede whatever operations Nemesis forces are planning in Crey's Folly.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P634468526" "Go to Crey's Folly and defeat Nemesis"
// SendOffString :
"P3206536511" "As I'm sure you know, Crey's Folly is a dangerous place, so I suggest you only go in there if you bring allies with you. Nemesis forces have been seen around the old Crey factories and Tangle Town, but don't feel like you have to limit your battles to that areas."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2490113361" "Defeat Nemesis in Crey's Folly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P462862934" "Go to Crey's Folly and defeat Nemesis troops there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1742620224" "Do not interfere with out operations in Crey's Folly, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1596100276" "You have defeated enough Nemesis troops in Crey's Folly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1307606362" "You did very well fighting those Nemesis soldiers. Whether or not they are actually controlled by the real Nemesis, I think that the Nemesis Army is counting on being able to intimidate heroes and villains alike with Nemesis's fearsome reputation. I'm glad to know that this generation of heroes will refuse to be intimidated."

